Downloaded once at dev time and committed verbatim so `architecture.html` is
self-contained and opens with no network access. The pin above is checked by
`tests/egress/test_render_html.py`; an accidental swap of this file for a
different version or a different library fails that test loudly rather than
silently shipping different rendering behaviour under an unchanged filename.
Upgrading is deliberate: bump `MERMAID_VERSION`/`MERMAID_SHA256` in
`src/sextant/egress/render/asset_pins.py` together with this file.

